; @ROM $CF936D | PC $0F936D | NATIVE DATA: Dog form descriptors
; REF_DOG_FORMS: descriptor pointer table $CF945D, word-indexed by native form ID.
;   Form IDs: $02 prehistoric, $04 alternate prehistoric, $06 Sacred Dog,
;   $08 Poodle, $0A Podunk, $0C Toaster. No new form IDs are introduced by L.
;   Seven 40-byte descriptors start at $CF936D; descriptor +$06 chooses palette,
;   +$08 supplies a form parameter, +$0A..+$26 select action/animation references.
;   Only fields consumed by the loader are described; unknown fields are not
;   assigned speculative purposes. The parameter at +$08 is not a combat-stat
;   multiplier declaration (ordinary forms contain $0020, Toaster $00FA).

; @ROM $CF936D | PC $0F936D | VERIFIED INTERVAL: Dog form descriptors
; CPU $CF936D-$CF945C; PC $0F936D-$0F945C; UNCHANGED.
; The classification covers this bounded interval only, not its callees or pointed-to data.

; @ROM $CF945D | PC $0F945D | VERIFIED INTERVAL: Dog form descriptor pointers
; CPU $CF945D-$CF946A; PC $0F945D-$0F946A; UNCHANGED.
; The classification covers this bounded interval only, not its callees or pointed-to data.

; @ROM $CF946B | PC $0F946B | NATIVE FUNCTION: load Dog form
; REF_DOG_FORM_LOAD: $CF946B-$CF9534, mirror $8F946B.
;   $7E2443 is the pending native form. Zero returns immediately. A nonzero value
;   becomes $7E2363 and clears $2443, loads the descriptor/action references,
;   selects palette/graphics, invokes $90CF3A, and recalculates through $8F857D.
;   The L feature reuses this unchanged routine; original region assignments
;   continue to use it. A form's animation tables, not the map's name, determine
;   its walking/running behavior. Hardware palette index for the Dog is $0E.
;   Measured straight-line pixels per frame in this release:
;     Prehistoric $02: walk 0.75, run 3.25; Sacred $06: walk 1.25, run 2.75;
;     Poodle $08: walk 1.75, run 2.50; Podunk $0A: walk 1.00, run 5.00;
;     Toaster $0C: walk 2.00, run 5.00. Alternate $04 uses run speed for both.
;   Measurements are from controlled movement fixtures, not inferred from sprites.

; @ROM $CF946B | PC $0F946B | VERIFIED INTERVAL: Dog native form loader
; CPU $CF946B-$CF9534; PC $0F946B-$0F9534; UNCHANGED.
