; @ROM $FCD000 | PC $3CD000 | EVENT HELPER: Footknight sword reward; skip duplicate ownership
; Explicit patch payload; nearby native context is documented separately.

; CHANGE [KnightSwordReward]: After Footknight's existing checkmate scene, grant Crusader Sword only
;   if missing. The duplicate case returns before equipping or notifying, preserving the player's
;   current weapon.
; LABEL KnightSwordReward:
; SOURCE NOTE: If the native Crusader Sword ownership bit is set, return without changing
; SOURCE NOTE: equipment or playing another acquisition notification (NG+/revisit safe).
; SYMBOLIC $FCD000: db $09,$05,$13,$04,$94
org $FCD000
    db $09, $05, $13, $04, $94

; SYMBOLIC $FCD005: dw KnightSwordReward.done-(pc()+2)
org $FCD005
    db $0C

; SOURCE NOTE: Queue the same native weapon-6 acquisition used by the former forest reward.
; SOURCE NOTE: $80 unhides the unwindowed acquisition text. Normal equip code owns inventory.
; SYMBOLIC $FCD007: db $18,$E9,$01,$B6,$80
org $FCD007
    db $18, $E9, $01, $B6, $80

; SYMBOLIC $FCD00C: db $52,$7A,$1C,$30,$44,$A7,$80
org $FCD00C
    db $52, $7A, $1C, $30, $44, $A7, $80

; LABEL KnightSwordReward.done:
; SYMBOLIC $FCD013: db $00

; @ROM $FCD080 | PC $3CD080 | EVENT HELPER: final copy Magic Gourd; skip duplicate ownership
; Explicit patch payload; nearby native context is documented separately.

; CHANGE [FinalCopyGourdReward]: Replace the final Dark Forest copy's former sword reward with Magic
;   Gourd. Test its actual inventory bit and skip duplicate grants without disturbing other charm
;   flags.
; LABEL FinalCopyGourdReward:
; SOURCE NOTE: Same ownership test and flag set as the existing Nobilia Magic Gourd trade.
; SOURCE NOTE: $2262.2 is inventory, so already-owned cases skip the grant and notification.
; SYMBOLIC $FCD080: db $09,$05,$52,$00,$94
org $FCD080
    db $09, $05, $52
org $FCD084
    db $94

; SYMBOLIC $FCD085: dw FinalCopyGourdReward.done-(pc()+2)
org $FCD085
    db $0C

; SYMBOLIC $FCD087: db $0C,$52,$00,$B1,$80
org $FCD087
    db $0C, $52
org $FCD08A
    db $B1, $80

